#
# WHAT IT GUARDS. On MSYS an extensionless probe candidate whose .exe sibling
# exists IS that .exe (exe magic), so resolve_plan_binary answered the DEBUG
# build ahead of a fresh release .exe whenever the release extensionless name
# held an unrunnable file (yolanda 2026-09-29). The probe now skips such
# candidates on MSYS/Cygwin only, and lets the .exe entries answer in their
# release-before-debug order. The fixture runs its MSYS arm on Git Bash and
# its Linux negative control (order unchanged) on Linux, each skipping the
# other by name. Pre-fix MSYS: 0/1, answering ./target/debug/tillandsias-plan.
#
# STEP_SCRIPT is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
